  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Procurement and distribution of Long Lasting Insecticidal Nets (LLINs) in Uganda to achieve universal LLIN coverage, contributing to the reduction of malaria related morbidity and mortality in Uganda.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Procurement and distribution of Long Lasting Insecticidal Nets (LLINs) in Uganda to achieve universal LLIN coverage, contributing to the reduction of malaria related morbidity and mortality in Uganda. is a component of Increasing coverage of Long Lasting Insecticide Nets in Uganda reported by FCDO with a funding type of 112 - Other bilateral donor and a budget of &#xA3;19,900,000. It works in the following sector(s): Malaria control, Health education.</narrative>
  </description>
